{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is approached, grab it and perform task, otherwise move to object. Finally, scan area for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />\"",
